  "hero_headline": "全球科技股集体回调，AI 算力与监管博弈加剧 / Global Tech Stocks Plunge Amid AI Regulatory Tensions",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球视点聚焦三大核心信号：首先是科技行业，AI 算力竞争步入具身智能与效率优化阶段，但在资本市场遭遇巨震，以 Anthropic 和 Nvidia 为首的科技股集体滑坡进入调整区间。其次，金融市场因避险情绪升温，叠加美国对离岸数据中心建设的征税威胁，引发了投资者对 AI 供应链资产配置的深度担忧。最后，时政领域显示地缘冲突与贸易摩擦持续，COP31 气候谈判陷入僵局，同时美国针对高端芯片的远程访问出口管控进一步收紧。各方力量在技术创新与政策封锁之间反复博弈，预示着行业正进入高强度的洗牌期。\n\nToday's global landscape is defined by three key developments. In technology, the focus has shifted toward embodied intelligence and efficiency, yet the sector faced a major market correction as major players like Anthropic and Nvidia slumped into bear/correction territory. In finance, investor anxiety has spiked due to a mix of cooling market sentiment and the U.S. government's threat of \"tremendous taxes\" on overseas data center construction. Geopolitically, tensions remain high with deadlocked climate negotiations at COP31 and the tightening of U.S. export controls on advanced AI chips, signaling a period of intense global realignment.",
